{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1481301-alternative-ascension-war-mage\u2019s-jyhad","id":1481301,"title":"Alternative Ascension War: Mage\u2019s Jyhad?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-17T10:51:44-07:00","id":1481301,"title":"Alternative Ascension War: Mage\u2019s Jyhad?","content":"Will the nature of Ascension War be contrary to its claim: just a war/game of some super powerful mages?<br /> <br /> Although the strict Ascension War has no more than 1000 years, its rudiment is much earlier. Not strange to me that finally becomes a tool for some archmages and oracles. And, magick always tends to be more secure than vampiric disciplines. For example, Mind/Entropy 6+(assuming it exists) may allow an oracle to rewrite the Consensus/Tellurian slowly but fundamentally<br /> <br /> One of original endings, Hell on Earth, does touch it, but that\u2019s very extreme. The whole Ascension War and humankind history are shaped by Fallen Oracles (of course this is never canonical). I also heard that MtAw has similar stuff but I never play it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24560,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","user":"Rock113","date":". 05-17-2022, 01:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-17T11:58:22-07:00","id":1481310,"title":"","content":"If you're looking at Awakening, it's very important to remember that in Awakening that's the background/history of the setting, rather than some looming end times:<br /> <br /> In the mythic past when magic was free-flowing, easily done, and soon, a bunch of high level mages got into a big old scuffle and the end result was permanently damaging the connection between the Supernal Realms where magical truth resides, and normal reality; turning our world into a Fallen World, where the supernal is tainted and twisted in the process of becoming reality so it is diminished from its higher glory. Humans are kept from their birthright to naturally interact with supernal truth and to use it to shape reality, with only a few people capable of going through the process to become mages by overcoming the scars that ancient war left on the fundamental nature of the universe.<br /> <br /> Or at least that's the common story of it all.<br /> <br /> There's plenty of evidence that that war between the Exarchs (the archmages that wanted to control the Supernal Realms and only let their selected elite access magic rather than anyone just suddenly waking up to the idea that they have the power to explode other people if they just want to badly enough), and the Oracles (the archmages that didn't want to risk destroying the link between the supernal and material realities) is still ongoing, but has been in a centuries long stalemate for some reason or twenty. Of course they're all stuck on the other side of the gates between our reality and the supernal, so it's hard to just ask them about it,<br /> <br /> That stalemate is essential to being the foundation of the setting rather than being an End Times scenario. Sure, any archmage could radically change things, but there's a bunch of others constantly working to stop that from happening for their own reasons. They're all so busy stopping each other from doing anything, nothing gets done on their side of things; leaving a place for the PCs to literally change their world if they can gather enough power to tip the scales in their side's favor and end the stalemate.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}